sdata> -- Issue #69: no test coverage exercises Run_REPL at all. This is the basic
sdata> -- sanity case -- immediate (REPEAT, RUN), deferred (LET, PRINT), and RUN
sdata> -- dispatch all correctly through the REPL's own dispatch loop, not batch's
sdata> -- Execute.
sdata> REPEAT 3
sdata> LET X = RECNO
sdata> LET Y = X * 2
sdata> RUN
RUN complete. 3 records and 2 variables processed.
sdata> PRINT X Y
sdata> RUN
1.00000 2.00000
2.00000 4.00000
3.00000 6.00000
RUN complete. 3 records and 2 variables processed.
sdata> QUIT
